		{
			dependencies: ["4D4F9D8F293B3637"]
			description: [
				"Complete one public system: a pantry supply line, experience archive, rail route, parcel depot or workshop that another player can use without you present."
				"Add a diagram, Ponder reminder or short instruction book. Include the safe startup, safe shutdown and the one mistake most likely to jam it."
				"The Chronicle calls this the Brass Road: motion made meaningful because it carries food, knowledge or travellers between homes."
				"Create addons extend the same readable machine language into kitchens, railways, decoration, and experience processing. Ponder addon blocks when available and use JEI when their recipe type is unfamiliar."
